# Captures and decoded artifacts are local-only research scratch.
# Don't commit: Ghidra dumps, USBPcap pcapngs, raw .syx captures.
# The directory itself is kept by a .gitkeep placeholder so Ghidra
# scripts have a place to write.
*
!.gitignore
!captured/
!captured/.gitkeep
!captured/decoded/
!captured/decoded/.gitkeep
